title: MOPEDS
message: "If you use MOPEDS in your work, please cite the paper below."

authors:
  - family-names: Kozachynskyi
    given-names: Volodymyr

repository-code: https://git.tu-berlin.de/dbta/optimization/mopeds

keywords:
  - parameter estimation
  - optimal experimental design
  - nonlinear programming
  - process systems engineering
  - CasADi
