preferred-citation:
  type: article
  authors:
    - family-names: Kozachynskyi
      given-names: Volodymyr
    - family-names: Illner
      given-names: Markus
    - family-names: Esche
      given-names: Erik
    - family-names: Repke
      given-names: Jens-Uwe
  title: The optimal experiment? Influence of solution strategies on model-based optimal experimental design
  journal: Computers & Chemical Engineering
  volume: 187
  year: 2024
  start: 108746
  doi: 10.1016/j.compchemeng.2024.108746
  url: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compchemeng.2024.108746

abstract: >
  MOPEDS is an open-source Python package for model-based parameter
  estimation and optimal experimental design of dynamic and steady-state
  models. The recommended citation is the accompanying publication
  describing the underlying optimal experimental design framework and
  solution strategies.
